    narr:narration """This hub holds a single deployment-gate decision, dated [a signed release manifest now required for every Meridian deployment](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1), recorded in a [decision register item naming the gate](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_3) with [scope covering staging and production](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_4) and [ownership attributed to Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_5). The stated rationale is [two unsigned artifacts that reached staging last quarter](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_2). It sits under the broader narrative of [mandatory signed manifest verification for release trains](narr:Narrative_SignedManifestGatesForReleaseTrains).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_2> ;
